#: ../../operations/budgets.rst:55
msgid ""
"If you scope a budget to a Cloud, visit the Cloud summary tab in "
"``Infrastructure > Clouds > Select Cloud`` to see a cost-to-budget "
"breakdown for that Cloud."
msgstr ""
"If you scope a budget to a Nube, visit the Nube summary tab in "
